# The changelog is one file per 0.Y series (doc/changelog/vX.Y.md) behind an
# index (doc/changelog/CHANGELOG.md). The pattern covers the whole tree, not
# the index alone: [Unreleased] moved into the series file being written, so
# a pattern naming only CHANGELOG.md would leave the one file branches
# actually append to on the default three-way merge.
doc/changelog/*.md merge=union
